            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The word that came to Jeremiah from the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Arise, and go down to the potter's house, and there I will let you hear my words.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I went down to the potter's house, and there he was working at his wheel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the vessel he was making of clay was spoiled in the potter's hand, and he reworked it into another vessel, as it seemed good to the potter to do.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " came to me: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 9.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “O house of Israel, can I not do with you as this potter has done? says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Behold, like the clay in the potter's hand, so are you in my hand, O house of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If at any time I declare concerning a nation or a kingdom, that I will pluck up and break down and destroy it, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and if that nation, concerning which I have spoken, turns from its evil, I will repent of the evil that I intended to do to it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if at any time I declare concerning a nation or a kingdom that I will build and plant it, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and if it does evil in my sight, not listening to my voice, then I will repent of the good which I had intended to do to it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now, therefore, say to the men of Judah and the inhabitants of Jerusalem: ‘Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", Behold, I am shaping evil against you and devising a plan against you. Return, every one from his evil way, and amend your ways and your doings.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“But they say, ‘That is in vain! We will follow our own plans, and will every one act according to the stubbornness of his evil heart.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then they said, “Come, let us make plots against Jeremiah, for the law shall not perish from the priest, nor counsel from the wise, nor the word from the prophet. Come, let us smite him with the tongue, and let us not heed any of his words.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
